<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-ECUADOR BEAT PARAGUAY 2-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ECUADOR BEAT PARAGUAY 2-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>COCHABAMBA, Bolivia 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador beat</p>
<p>Paraguay 2-0 (halftime 0-0) in a Copa America first round</p>
<p>group A match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Wellington Sanchez (72nd minute), Ariel Graziani</p>
<p>(86th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,000</p>
</text>
